/*!
\page page_sttriggerdata StTriggerData

\brief Abstract base class for year-specific STAR trigger data; uniform interface to all sub-detectors.

\section sttriggerdata_overview Overview
\c StTriggerData is a <b>pure abstract base class</b> providing a uniform,
year-independent interface to all STAR trigger sub-detector data.
Concrete subclasses (e.g. \c StTriggerData2019) decode the raw trigger banks for
a specific run year.  The \c prepost argument selects a RHIC bunch crossing
relative to the triggered one: 0=triggered, negative=pre, positive=post (range −5 to +5).

\note This class cannot be instantiated directly.  Access it via \c StEvent::triggerData().

\section sttriggerdata_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StTriggerData          ← pure abstract
           ├── StTriggerData2003
           ├── ...
           └── StTriggerData2019
\endcode

\section sttriggerdata_members Data Members
No concrete data members.  All data resides in year-specific subclasses.

\section sttriggerdata_methods Key Methods (virtual interface)

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `unsigned int version() const` | Data format version |
| `unsigned int token() const` | Trigger token |
| `unsigned int triggerWord() const` | L0 hardware trigger word |
| `unsigned int actionWord() const` | Trigger action word |
| `unsigned int numberOfPreXing() const` | Pre-crossings available |
| `unsigned int numberOfPostXing() const` | Post-crossings available |
| `unsigned int bunchId48Bit() const` | 48-bit bunch-crossing ID |
| `unsigned int bunchId7Bit() const` | 7-bit bunch-crossing ID |
| `unsigned int bbcAdcEast(int pmt, int prepost=0) const` | BBC east ADC |
| `unsigned int bbcAdcWest(int pmt, int prepost=0) const` | BBC west ADC |
| `unsigned int bbcTacEast(int pmt, int prepost=0) const` | BBC east TAC/TDC |
| `unsigned int bbcTacWest(int pmt, int prepost=0) const` | BBC west TAC/TDC |
| `unsigned int zdcSumEast(int prepost=0) const` | ZDC east ADC sum |
| `unsigned int zdcSumWest(int prepost=0) const` | ZDC west ADC sum |
| `unsigned int ctbSum() const` | Total CTB multiplicity |
| `unsigned int vpdEarliestTDCEast(int prepost=0) const` | VPD earliest TDC east |
| `unsigned int vpdEarliestTDCWest(int prepost=0) const` | VPD earliest TDC west |
| `unsigned long long l2sum() const` | 64-bit L2 trigger summary |
| `bool isL2Triggered(StL2TriggerResultType) const` | Check L2 result type |
| `unsigned int errorFlag() const` | Data-integrity flag (0=OK) |
| `virtual void dump() const = 0` | Pure virtual debug dump |

\section sttriggerdata_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StTriggerData* td = event->triggerData();
cout << "Token=" << td->token() << endl;
for (int pmt = 0; pmt < 16; ++pmt)
    cout << "BBC east ADC[" << pmt << "]=" << td->bbcAdcEast(pmt) << endl;
cout << "ZDC east sum (pre-1)=" << td->zdcSumEast(-1) << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_stl0trigger
\see \ref page_stbbctriggerdetector
\see \ref page_stzdctriggerdetector
*/
